It is the month of February now.
Today is Tuesday.
Every day in the morning, I go to the office.
Today, I go to a small shop first.
That is a bicycle repair shop.
This shop is near my flat.
Sometimes I go to the office on my bicycle.
But today my bicycle is broken.
I give my bicycle to the mechanic.
He is fixing a wheel now.
I ask him.
"At what time will I get the bicycle?"
He looks at my bicycle.
He tells me.
"Tomorrow is Wednesday."
"Come on Wednesday evening."
"Come at six fifteen."
I always come from the office at that time.
I walk to the office.
